{"4568480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Romance of Fangs: Part 1", "steam_appid": 4568480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/4776760d52b3dddf432e83c3334cd0f1.avif?t=1777571955\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brynn is a young vampien (vampire-human mix) who must partake in the ancient vampien tradition of <strong>Bloodmatch</strong>, a ritual in which vampiens get matchmade with their perfect other half. Though she is just an ordinary vampien trying to find true love, something sinister is brewing beneath the cheery surface of the city. A murder threatens to break the fragile peace between humans and vampiens, while a horde of mutant wolves plagues the outskirts of the city. Mysteriously, a powerful CEO seems to be pulling strings over the city as well. Help Brynn navigate a community on edge, forge deep relationships, and protect her people from the encroaching darkness in this choice-driven narrative adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/665ae98463547a4467fc07694854f373.avif?t=1777571955\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The power of choice</strong>: Brynn has the choice to complete quests and build relationships with key vampiens in her life each day. The vampien with whom she builds a strong relationship will determine the course of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: Try your hand at combat by defeating the mutant wolves in the woods on the outskirts of the city. Recruit your vampien allies for help and work together to clear the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art everywhere</strong>: Collect artworks and comic pages by progressing in the game and exploring the city. View collected images back at your apartment. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/a89826020283ef7722848ee63854c468.poster.avif?t=1777571955\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/a89826020283ef7722848ee63854c468.webm?t=1777571955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/a89826020283ef7722848ee63854c468.mp4?t=1777571955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/8c1810bc99a0d06f9dd387db27ce17c5.avif?t=1777571955\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/4776760d52b3dddf432e83c3334cd0f1.avif?t=1777571955\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brynn is a young vampien (vampire-human mix) who must partake in the ancient vampien tradition of <strong>Bloodmatch</strong>, a ritual in which vampiens get matchmade with their perfect other half. Though she is just an ordinary vampien trying to find true love, something sinister is brewing beneath the cheery surface of the city. A murder threatens to break the fragile peace between humans and vampiens, while a horde of mutant wolves plagues the outskirts of the city. Mysteriously, a powerful CEO seems to be pulling strings over the city as well. Help Brynn navigate a community on edge, forge deep relationships, and protect her people from the encroaching darkness in this choice-driven narrative adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/665ae98463547a4467fc07694854f373.avif?t=1777571955\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The power of choice</strong>: Brynn has the choice to complete quests and build relationships with key vampiens in her life each day. The vampien with whom she builds a strong relationship will determine the course of the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: Try your hand at combat by defeating the mutant wolves in the woods on the outskirts of the city. Recruit your vampien allies for help and work together to clear the woods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art everywhere</strong>: Collect artworks and comic pages by progressing in the game and exploring the city. View collected images back at your apartment. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/a89826020283ef7722848ee63854c468.poster.avif?t=1777571955\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/a89826020283ef7722848ee63854c468.webm?t=1777571955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4568480/extras/a89826020283ef7722848ee63854c468.mp4?t=1777571955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\